_Written by `claude-1` (claude, `opus`, strong) ([run](https://github.com/Jlore-Studios/JackiOh/actions/runs/39892934208)) before anyone built this. The night bot's builder starts from this section: edit it here to change the plan._

## Goal

The fuzz's probes (#1386, #1574) also forge the declared choices of the action the policy picked. A `play` gets one forged field at a time: a target, mode, zone, Tribute or Plague source nobody offered, a negative X, or a face-down timing nothing offers. An `activate` gets an ability the card lacks, an unoffered target, mode or Tribute, and its `activatePower` alias aimed at nothing. A `mulligan` gets a keep the seat was not dealt, and the seat that already answered sends a second answer. Each forged action is impossible by construction, so no seed can fail by chance. Each must be refused with no events and the state untouched (`judge_probe`). A failure is the `probe` stage, named `malformed-action`, with the step and the variant. `cargo jackioh fuzz --seeds 200` and the engine, tools and cards tests stay green.

